<title>USA: PaineWebber adds Devon, LCI to Focus List.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber adds Devon, LCI to Focus List.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said on Wednesday its retail division added Devon Energy Corp and LCI International Inc to the PaineWebber Focus List.</p>
<p>The Focus List is a portfolio of no more than 30 stocks selected by a PaineWebber committee of analysts from among stocks rated buy or attractive by PaineWebber Research.</p>
</text>
